FLOW_UNITS           CMS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
LINK_OFFSETS         DEPTH
MIN_SLOPE            0.001
ALLOW_PONDING        NO
SKIP_STEADY_STATE    NO

START_DATE           01/01/2024
START_TIME           00:00:00
