REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2024
END_TIME             06:00:00
SWEEP_START          01/01
SWEEP_END            12/31
DRY_DAYS             2
REPORT_STEP          00:05:00
WET_STEP             00:01:00
